sequenceDiagram
  participant HR as HR Recruiter
  participant Bot as Telegram Bot
  participant API as Azure Functions
  participant GitHub as GitHub API
  participant Model as Qwen Service
  participant DB as Cosmos DB
  participant Notify as Service Bus/Worker

  HR->>Bot: /analyze github-user
  Bot->>API: webhook update
  API->>GitHub: fetch public profile data
  GitHub-->>API: profile data
  API->>Model: summarize and score
  Model-->>API: structured analysis
  API->>DB: save report/session
  API-->>Bot: return concise result
  API->>Notify: schedule reminder if needed
  Notify-->>API: status/ack
